that tax year.
39-15-111. Distribution.
(b) Revenues earned under W.S. 39-15-104 during each fiscal year shall be
recognized as revenue during that fiscal year for accounting purposes. Except
as otherwise provided in subsection subsections (p) and (r) of this section,
for all revenue collected by the department under W.S. 39-15-104 the department
